iew text that I've noticed. It wasn't one of the expanded chapters. For more Promethean stuff we'll have to wait for the Black Death, 30 Years War, and the &quot;Year Without a Summer&quot; chapters in the Companion.<br /> <br /> That said, if you weren't familiar with what was already in the Dustbowl chapter, there's a new Lineage, the Hollow. They were founded by an Extemporae and can only make more of their kind from bodies that died of deprivation. Their Wastelands are Dust storms,and they can only make more of their kind or hope for the Golden Dawn while the Dustbowl continues. When the rains come, those that don't achieve humanity or burn out in the attempt are going to be doomed to wander without hope.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}